## 4. Task Planning

| Task             | Description                           |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Data Preparation | Prepare employee information in Excel |
| Table Creation   | Create Employee Test table            |
| Data Loading     | Load spreadsheet into ServiceNow      |
| Import Set       | Store imported data temporarily       |
| Transform Map    | Connect source and target tables      |
| Field Mapping    | Map source fields to target fields    |
| Transformation   | Transfer data to Employee Test        |
| Verification     | Check imported records                |
| Testing          | Test the complete import process      |
| Documentation    | Prepare project documents             |
| Demonstration    | Record project demo video             |

